  <History Date="03-02-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="12-06-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Changed Manufacturer" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised classic pearl refs.  Changed dimmer from raw to percentage range and fixed locate value." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised shutter function ranges.  Increased wheel resolution." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour macro functions.  Moved Auto and Auto Spd into Effect group." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed 'Store' attribute from AR1S mode and replaced with shutter." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID to ARC.1 mode." />
  <History Date="14-09-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed BLOCK mode cell references in response to bug report." />
  <History Date="21-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSI modes and linked to vdim for compatibility" />
  <History Date="21-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
  <History Date="21-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised display name." />
